        {"source": "spec", "quote": "3.3 V rail: An LD39200PU33R LDO, fed from the 5 V rail, produces 3V3 for \"MCUs and Sensors\""}
      ],
      "impact": "MCUs receive no power, board completely non-functional.",
      "confidence": 1.0
    },
    {
